OL,3,GNEWSA'End of an era' for ice cream shop
OL,4,Aopen 106 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at a much-loved family-run ice
OL,7,Fcream business say they are
OL,8,F"devastated" after announcing it is
OL,9,Fclosing its doors after 106 years of
OL,10,Fbusiness due to rising costs.
OL,12,FTarr's Ice Cream first opened in the
OL,13,FBrislington area of Bristol in the
OL,14,F1920s and fast became a place where
OL,15,Flocal families would head to get a
OL,16,Ftreat. It was also named Bristol's
OL,17,FFamily Business of the Year in 2018.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
