OL,3,GNEWSA'End of an era' for ice cream shop
OL,4,Aopen 106 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut after weathering through the
OL,7,Flockdowns of Covid-19 and struggling
OL,8,Fwith the continuing rising costs of
OL,9,Foperating, the family said things were
OL,10,F"extremely difficult" to sustain.
OL,12,FBradley Tarr, a fourth generation
OL,13,Fmember of the family, said: "It is a
OL,14,Fsad time... but it's had to happen
OL,15,Funfortunately."
